            <p class="drop-cap">Money management in 2026 is more important than ever before. As the costs of living increase, digital financial services evolve, the labor markets shift, and access to credit becomes dangerously simple, novices can easily have a panic attack when working to establish financial security. Personal finance advice is not just about being wealthy, but rather it is about being in charge of your money, making smart choices, and building a stress-free future.</p>

            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1554224155-8d04cb21cd6c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80" alt="Financial Planning Strategy" class="article-image">
